  "name": "Venomancer: Venomous Bite and Protraction work natively (#1289, #1306)",
  "contract": "#1289, #1306: both are Spell.dbc spell modifiers. Venomous Bite (630900) is a flat SPELLMOD_MAX_AURA_STACKS (aura 107, misc 31, bp 1 so +2) on mask (0,1,0), which selects Brood Mark (804972, StackAmount 5), so its cap must go 5 to 7; the harness set_aura fixture enforces that same limit, so a 7-stack fixture only succeeds with the passive. Protraction (706942 rank 1, 707871 rank 2) effect 1 is a flat SPELLMOD_DURATION (aura 107, misc 1, bp 2999/5999 so +3000/+6000 ms) on mask (0x2042,0x8,0x10180), which selects Wilt, Spore, Miasma, Facemelter and Blight Venom; it is asserted through the native spell-modifier query on a 10000 ms base, with Antivenom Dispel (mask outside) as the control. Protraction's tooltip says periodic damage effects, yet its mask also reaches Debilitating Venom's slow (805895) and Hivebreak (no duration); that overreach is not asserted.",
